# Team Template: Cloud Migration — Overview

## Team Composition (8 FTE, 24 weeks)

| Role | Count | Allocation | Rate | Weekly Cost |
|------|-------|------------|------|-------------|
| Engagement Manager | 1 | 50% | $1,800 | $4,500 |
| Solution Architect | 1 | 100% | $1,600 | $8,000 |
| Sr. Consultant — Infra | 2 | 100% | $1,400 | $14,000 |
| Consultant — App | 2 | 100% | $1,100 | $11,000 |
| Analyst — Data | 1 | 100% | $800 | $4,000 |
| DevOps Engineer | 1 | 100% | $1,200 | $6,000 |

**Total weekly onshore cost**: ~$47,500
**24-week engagement**: ~$485,000 (professional services)

## Key Responsibilities
- **Engagement Manager**: Governance, stakeholder management, budget tracking
- **Solution Architect**: Architecture design, platform selection, technical authority
- **Senior Consultants**: Cloud provisioning, network architecture, IaC, security baseline
- **Consultants**: App assessment, containerization, CI/CD, code modernization
- **Analyst**: Data profiling, ETL pipeline, migration, validation
- **DevOps Engineer**: Automation, monitoring, DR configuration, release management

## Governance Cadence
- Daily standup (15 min, all)
- Bi-weekly sprint planning (2 hours)
- Weekly architecture review (1 hour)
- Monthly steering committee (2 hours, executives)

## Scaling Options
- **Small** (<$300K): Reduce to 5 FTE, 16 weeks
- **Large** (>$700K): Add second Solution Architect, Security Specialist
- **Enterprise** (>$1M): Add Program Director, nearshore/offshore mix
